    %% find_nearest_match is a static query over unsaved criteria, not a saved request.
    %% submitted requests have one addressed bank; accepting bank remains optional until acceptance.
    %% Both bank references agree on acceptance. Acceptance reserves the full exact-match quantity atomically.
    %% Reevaluate similar pending requests in that decision; preserve manual/automatic rejection audit.
    %% Processing and final laboratory results each trigger availability reevaluation; expiry is checked at use time.
    %% Notices are bank-scoped pending-request and expired-component worklists, not new persistent entities.
    %% forecast_runs owns frozen provenance and demand_forecasts stores immutable daily predictions.
    %% retrieve_saved never recalculates or substitutes another run. Forecasting does not mutate stock.
    %% Existing entity/attribute names were preserved; new forecast entities and routing/audit fields are additive.
